      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_02",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "今は根性じゃなくて、少し軽くする作戦にしよ。まず肩の力を抜いて。",
      "displayText": "Right now, use a lighter plan, not willpower. First, let your shoulders loosen.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "warm",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": "Rest first.",
          "nextId": "player_tired_001_rest"
        },
        {
          "label": "Tiny step, then rest.",
          "nextId": "player_tired_001_tiny_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_rest",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "うん、先に休もう。その判断、ちゃんとえらい。",
      "displayText": "Mm, rest first. That decision is properly good.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "player_tired_001_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "gentle",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_tiny_step",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "小さい一歩だけね。約束。終わったらちゃんと止まるところまで含めて作戦。",
      "displayText": "Only one tiny step. Promise. Stopping after it is part of the plan.",
      "language": "japanese",
      "voice": "alterra",
      "audioKey": "",
      "nextId": "player_tired_001_03",
      "presentation": {
        "expression": "focused",
        "animation": ""
      },
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "player_tired_001_03",
      "speaker": "alterra",
      "text": "それでも続けたいなら、量じゃなくて形を決めよう。三分だけ、ここまでだけ、みたいに。",
      "displayText": "If you still want to continue, decide the shape instead of the amount: just three minutes, just up to here.",
